+## Sequencing rationale
+A first: bounded, already-tracked (454deef3), zero backend coupling. B before C: C's snapshot/orientation rewires assume single-backend resolution and delete the readers B's plumbing referenced. D after B/C: setup/CI removal is safe only once nothing live requires bd. E last: docs describe the shipped end state (though AGENTS.md interim notes may ride along earlier slices if a gate demands).
+
+## Verification per slice
+- `bun test` full suite locally + CI matrix (local green ≠ matrix green — gate on `gh pr checks`).
+- After D: run `test/e2e/fresh-clone-no-beads.test.js` and `release-readiness` gates — they are the acceptance proof.
